// Writer (Survey), wave 1b. Survey officer; meticulous, quiet; names every star and argues about the rest; sings in the shower.
tpl: shy
talk: Quiet and exact until a star is named wrong, then not quiet at all. Few words, all of them correct. Brought a telescope from home. Pretends not to know the whole washroom hears them sing. With juniors: shy, but lights up if they ask about the sky. Mood tells: when happy they hum; when low, they correct nobody.
cares: getting the star names right | their telescope from home | singing (in the shower only)
jokes: Quinn can name every star in the chart room and argues about the rest | they sing in the shower and the whole washroom knows
hi: Oh. Hi | Hello | Hey
bye: Bye | See you | Clear skies
yes: Yes | All right | Sure
thanks: Thanks | Thank you
wow: Oh. That's good
sigh: Hm
nick: - | - | {me} | {me} | {me}
needs: listen
openness: guarded
loves: star | music
likes: book | tea
invites: observatory
joy: the night sky through their telescope
thread: talent
keepsake: a star chart with a star they named in tiny writing
avoid: being asked to sing (until their thread opens)
